# Commands Omarchy calls that belong to tools this host replaces. Each is a
# stub in lib/monarchy/stubs/alias-*.sh that says what it maps onto and runs
# that instead, as yay runs paru. Installed into the overlay and into
# /usr/local/bin, which sudo's secure_path reaches. ADR 0005.
#
# Not here, on purpose: limine-entry-tool, which edits ESP boot entries and
# has no counterpart, and snapper, because Omarchy checks `command -v snapper`
# and would then set snapper up. Snapshots go to ZFS through omarchy-snapshot.

limine-mkinitcpio
limine-update
limine-snapper-sync
